    ["%s系统未开启"] = "The %s system is not enabled.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Castle Template】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Instructions: </>\nOpen <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - Recommended</> tab, or {JumpToUI:[点击这里]|1250327}, to browse and download recommended templates.\nOpen <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - My</> tab, select a saved template, and click <Assistant_System>Apply Template</> to apply it to your current castle.\nIn <Assistant_System>Castle - Decoration Interface - Save/Apply</>, you can also apply saved templates or save your current castle decoration as a template.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tip: </>\nYou can also go to the <Assistant_System>Decoration Plaza</> to view templates uploaded by other players; you can save and use templates you like.\n<Assistant_Title2>Delete Template: </>\nTo delete a saved template, go to <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - My</>, select the target template, and click the delete button in the <Assistant_System>top right corner</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Castle Template】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Instructions: </>\nOpen <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - Recommended</> tab, or {JumpToUI:[Click Here]|1250327}, to browse and download recommended templates.\nOpen <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - My</> tab, select a saved template, and click <Assistant_System>Apply Template</> to apply it to your current castle.\nIn <Assistant_System>Castle - Decoration Interface - Save/Apply</>, you can also apply saved templates or save your current castle decoration as a template.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tip: </>\nYou can also go to the <Assistant_System>Decoration Plaza</> to view templates uploaded by other players; you can save and use templates you like.\n<Assistant_Title2>Delete Template: </>\nTo delete a saved template, go to <Assistant_System>Menu - Castle - Template - My</>, select the target template, and click the delete button in the <Assistant_System>top right corner</>.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>皇室华缎・巅峰王服\n王至，时代为之开辟；王立，权与力为之俯首。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Royal Satin・Peak King's Attire\nWhen the King arrives, an era is paved for him; when the King stands, power and strength bow before him.",
    ["<P_Heart>（你大概知道发生了什么，看着眼前稚嫩而单纯的孩子，沉默了一会。）</> 我愿意。"] = "<P_Heart> (You roughly know what happened, and looking at the naive and innocent child before you, you fall silent for a moment.) </> I am willing.",
    ["<P_Heart>（咦，好像不对，我再想想。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Huh, that doesn't seem right either, let me think again.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>嗯……<P_Yellow>徽章</>。"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> Hmm... the <P_Yellow>badge</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉默良久）</>……没想过。"] = "<P_Heart> (Silent for a long time) </>... I haven't thought about it.",
    ["<P_Heart>（烦躁）</>不止啊。还有那望不到头的未来！满城的煤烟、噪声和钢铁怪物，哪里容得下一张安静的书桌？我的笔，写得出诗句，却劈不开这厚重的迷雾。"] = "<P_Heart> (Irritated) </> It's not just that. There's also the endless future! The city full of coal smoke, noise, and steel monsters—where is there room for a quiet desk? My pen can write poetry, but it can't cut through this thick fog.",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑了一下）</>谢谢医生。"] = "<P_Heart> (Smiled slightly) </> Thank you, doctor.",
    ["<P_Heart>（肚子里的婴儿会哼歌、吹口哨？怎么听着不对劲……最好用灵视查看下。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The baby in her stomach hums and whistles? That doesn't sound right... It's best to check with spirit vision.) </>",
